00:16:16.010 --> 00:16:25.350
Rep. Joel R. Chua: ang Land Bank of the Philippines Show Bolivar Branch ang nagproseso ng encashment ng apat na cheque

00:16:27.120 --> 00:17:11.620
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Payable sa isang Gina F. Acosta sa halagang 125 million each. Sa mga sumusunod na cheque. Una, Land Bank Check Number 0000244027 na may petsang December 20, 2022. Ikalawa, Land Bank. Check number 0000244053 na may pet siyang January 31, 2023.

00:17:13.410 --> 00:17:46.760
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Ikatlo, land bank check number 0000245511 na may pet siyang April 18, 2023. At ikapat, land bank check number 0000245664 na may pechang July 13, 2023.

00:17:49.150 --> 00:18:04.700
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Katlo, na ang mga nasabing cheque ay lahat pinunduhan ng Philippine Treasury at nilipat sa account. ng Office of the Vice President.

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:32.180
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Kaapat, na ang apat na nasabing cheque ay personal na in-encash ng isang Ms. Gina F. Acosta bilang SDO o Special Disbursing Officer ng Office of the Vice President noong December 20, 2022.

00:18:34.380 --> 00:18:47.620
Rep. Joel R. Chua: February 6, 2023, April 25, 2023, at July 14, 2023.

00:18:52.230 --> 00:18:53.310
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Ikalima,

00:18:55.770 --> 00:19:18.140
Rep. Joel R. Chua: bilang Department Manager ng Land Bank Show Boulevard Branch, si Ms. Constantino ay personal na nakasaksi at nag-oversee ng pag-encash, At pagtanggap ng pera mula sa cheque ni Ms. Acosta.

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:21.940
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Ito yung panghuli.

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:40.720
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Kaanim, iba pang mga bagay-bagay na may kinalaman dito sa impeachment case in relation to Article 1 on confidential funds and in relation to the aforementioned purposes, Your Honor.

