00:49:28.400 --> 00:49:43.640
Violeta Constantino: Bali po, biniverify po ito ni verifier, yung mga auto-resignatories po ng cheque. And then, sinicheck niya rin po sa system kung ito po ay mayroon ng advice from the OVP para po ito ay i-release na.

00:49:44.120 --> 00:49:51.550
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Okay. So pagkatapos po maicheck, kung mayroon ng advice, ano na po ang susunod na mangyayari kung mayroon man po?

00:49:51.950 --> 00:49:57.950
Violeta Constantino: Na-forward na po ito sa teller para po i-encode sa system at para po makapag-request na po siya ng cash.

00:49:58.380 --> 00:50:03.860
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Okay. So pag forward sa Taylor, ano na po ang susunod na mangyayari kung meron man po?

00:50:04.840 --> 00:50:12.480
Violeta Constantino: Pag po na-approve na rin po ng approver, tatawagin na po niya si Ms. Gina Costa para po mapareceive niya po yung cash.

00:50:12.840 --> 00:50:19.820
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Okay. So sabi ninyo, tatawagin ni approver si Ms. Gina Costa para tanggapin na yung cash.

00:50:19.820 --> 00:50:21.980
Violeta Constantino: Si Taylor po ang tumatawag.

00:50:21.980 --> 00:50:26.380
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Okay. Tatawagin ni Taylor si Ms. Gina Costa para...

00:50:26.380 --> 00:50:27.860
Violeta Constantino: Ipa-receive na po yung cash.

00:50:27.860 --> 00:50:28.880
Violeta Constantino: Ipa-receive na yung cash.

00:50:28.880 --> 00:50:34.660
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Ano na po ang susunod mangyayari pagkatapos pong i-inform ni Taylor si Ms. Gina Acosta?

00:50:35.220 --> 00:50:44.920
Violeta Constantino: Bale, since malaka din nga po yung amount, inaguide po si Gina Acosta papasok po sa backroom para po doon i-release yung cash.

00:50:45.460 --> 00:50:49.340
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Okay. Ngayon, may binabanggit po kayong backroom.

00:50:50.870 --> 00:50:54.650
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Sino-sino po ang nasa backroom kung alam po ninyo?

00:50:55.730 --> 00:51:04.870
Violeta Constantino: Noong pong unang release po noong cash, ako po ang nandoon, si Teller, yung branch cashier, si Ms. Gina, and then si Mr. Limuel po,

00:51:04.950 --> 00:51:11.150
Rep. Joel R. Chua: or Tonyo. So pagdating ninyo sa backroom, ano na po yung mga sumunod na pangyayari kung meron na po?

00:51:13.420 --> 00:51:26.790
Violeta Constantino: Nirelease po yung ng Teller po, after po ma-receive sa cheque po, yung payment received, nirelease na po ni Teller yung cash. kay Ms. Gina, in packs po siya, worth 1 million each po.

00:51:27.250 --> 00:51:33.070
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Okay. So, maalala po ba ninyo kung ilang packs po ang nirelease kay Ms. Gina Acosta?

00:51:33.630 --> 00:51:35.670
Violeta Constantino: Bali, 125 packs po.

00:51:35.810 --> 00:51:47.350
Rep. Joel R. Chua: 125 packs. Okay. Now, pagkatapos pong i-release itong pera in packs, in 125 packs, ano na po ang susunod na mangyayari?

00:51:47.710 --> 00:51:51.290
Violeta Constantino: Bali, nilalagay na po nila yun sa dala po nilang bags.

00:51:51.970 --> 00:51:54.450
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Okay. Ngayon, meron po kayong binanggit na bag.

00:51:56.130 --> 00:52:03.370
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Madam Witness, anong klaseng bag ang pinaglagyan ng pera kung maalala po ninyo?

00:52:03.610 --> 00:52:12.130
Violeta Constantino: Sa pagkaalala ko po, isang mahabang malaking bag po siya. Para pong gym bag.

00:52:12.490 --> 00:52:21.270
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Okay. Madam Witness, ilang bag po ang dala po ni Ms. Gina Acosta at ni Mr. Ortonio?

00:52:21.630 --> 00:52:25.450
Violeta Constantino: Sa pagkaalala ko po, mga 3 to 4 bags po yun.

00:52:25.550 --> 00:52:35.490
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Okay. Now, Madam Witness, sabi ninyo, nilagay dito yung 125 million sa 3 to 4 bags. Okay.

00:52:37.300 --> 00:52:44.700
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Ano na po ang susunod na mangyayari pagkalagay po nila dito po sa bag?

00:52:46.340 --> 00:52:47.900
Violeta Constantino: Lalabas na po sila ng bangko.

00:52:48.000 --> 00:52:58.290
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Okay. Madam Witness, si Ms. Gina Acosta lang po ba? May kasama pa po ba si Ms. Gina Acosta at si Lemuel Ortonio?

00:52:59.210 --> 00:53:01.870
Violeta Constantino: Sa pagkaalala po, meron po silang kasama.

00:53:02.090 --> 00:53:03.690
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Ilan po? Kung maalala po ninyo?

00:53:03.890 --> 00:53:05.090
Violeta Constantino: Hindi ko na po ma-recall.

00:53:05.450 --> 00:53:07.230
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Okay. Now, Madam Witness,

00:53:07.810 --> 00:53:08.470
Rep. Joel R. Chua: ang

00:53:09.180 --> 00:53:21.200
Rep. Joel R. Chua: tanong ko po sa inyo, paglabas po nila, meron po ba sa banko na empleyado na tumulong sa kanila para bitbitin po itong bag kung meron man po?

00:53:21.200 --> 00:53:22.200
Violeta Constantino: Wala po, sir.

00:53:22.200 --> 00:53:23.160
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Bakit po wala?

00:53:24.190 --> 00:53:31.790
Violeta Constantino: It's against bank policy po na tumulong po sa mga kliyente, ang mga empleyado or even po yung security guards po namin.

00:53:32.430 --> 00:53:34.870
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Bakit po yun against sa bank policy, Madam Witness?

00:53:35.730 --> 00:53:45.990
Violeta Constantino: In case po na for safety and security measures din po, para po hands-off na po ang banko once na marilis na po yung physical cash po.

00:53:46.450 --> 00:53:50.070
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Okay. Now, Madam Witness, ito pong huling tanong ko.

00:53:52.280 --> 00:53:59.900
Rep. Joel R. Chua: How much po in total, Madam Witness, Ang winidro in relation po dito po sa apat na cheque, binabanggit po ninyo?

00:54:01.460 --> 00:54:07.120
Violeta Constantino: Ang total po ng apat na cheque, mga ano po siya, kalahating billion po.

00:54:07.720 --> 00:54:10.660
Rep. Joel R. Chua: Okay. That would be all, Your Honor.

00:54:12.350 --> 00:54:20.050
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: Thank you, Honorable Chua. Cross from the Council for Respondent. Attorney Poa, you may proceed when you're ready, sir.

00:54:20.410 --> 00:54:26.110
Atty. Michael Wesley Poa: Nothing to cross, Your Honor, from our end. However, Your Honor, may I just make a manifestation just on the markings, Your Honor?

00:54:26.530 --> 00:54:28.050
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: Council may do

