Atty. Michael Wesley Poa: so. Just on the markings of the check, we'd also like to put on record, Your Honors, that for check with ending 244027 dated December 20, 2022, this is marked by the prosecution on the face of the check as D-1-130-OBP. On the dorsal portion, it is D-1-130-OBP. OVP-1. For the second check, dated January 31, 2023, ending with 244053.

00:55:03.370 --> 00:55:23.300
Atty. Michael Wesley Poa: On the face of the check, this is marked as D-1-131-OVP. Torsel portion is marked as D-1-131-OVP-1. For the third check, dated April 13, 2023, with ending 245511.

