Atty. Michael Wesley Poa: face of the check was marked as D-1-132-OVP while the dorsal portion was marked as D-1-132-OVP-1. The fourth and last check ending 245664 dated July 13, 2023. The face of the check was marked as D-1-133-OVP while the dorsal portion was marked as T-1-133-OVP-1. That is all, Your Honors. Again, nothing to cross from our end.

00:56:02.530 --> 00:56:14.570
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: Yeah. Yeah. Just to correct you, the check ending in 5511 is dated April

00:56:14.920 --> 00:56:17.520
Atty. Michael Wesley Poa: 18. Correct, Yon. April 18, 2023.

00:56:18.000 --> 00:56:19.520
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: No, you mentioned 13 earlier.

00:56:19.600 --> 00:56:22.440
Atty. Michael Wesley Poa: So it's 18. Yes, 18, Yon. Thank you.

00:56:27.770 --> 00:56:57.010
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: Given that there is no cross and therefore no redirect, we now proceed to allow the senator judges for their interventions in the order that they signify their intent to ask questions and make interventions. The Honorable Erwin Tulfo, thereafter, the Honorable Rafi Tulfo, thereafter, the Honorable Senator Judge Aquino. The Honorable Tulfo is recognized for his interjections and interventions. You have two minutes, sir. Thank you, Mr. Presiding Officer.

00:56:57.370 --> 00:57:11.840
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Ms. Witness, Ms. Constantino, dyan ba talaga ang account ng mga OVP sa bangko ninyo sa show? Or si VP lang ang nag-open ang account dyan sa bangko ninyo?

00:57:12.140 --> 00:57:14.380
Violeta Constantino: Yung Office of the Vice President po.

00:57:14.820 --> 00:57:20.660
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: OVP? Opo. So hindi lahat dyan may account ang OVP?

00:57:21.790 --> 00:57:23.390
Violeta Constantino: Wala na po kung alam.

00:57:23.490 --> 00:57:24.090
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Okay.

00:57:26.410 --> 00:57:31.830
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Kaya nga po, tanong mo natin, si dating VP Robredo po ba nagbukas din ang account dyan?

00:57:32.470 --> 00:57:46.490
Violeta Constantino: Actually po, na-transfer lang po sa amin ang MDS account po ng Office of the Vice President noong September 2022, noong lumipat po sila ng kanilang office address sa Pioneer, Mandaluyong.

00:57:47.060 --> 00:57:54.290
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Ah, okay. Normal po ba na ganito kalaki ang wini-withdraw ng isang government agency?

00:57:55.840 --> 00:58:00.860
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Is this normal? Nakakita ka na ba nito ng other government agencies na ganito kalaki ang withdrawal?

00:58:02.120 --> 00:58:03.920
Violeta Constantino: Wala po. Unusual po ito.

00:58:04.740 --> 00:58:13.000
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Unusual yung withdrawal. So therefore, kung unusual, Madam Witness, hindi mo kayo nagtanong man lang, para saan po ba kayo ito?

00:58:13.120 --> 00:58:21.440
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Kasi alam ko sa banko po, nagtatanong ako po, nagbabango ko sa privado, natatanong po yung staff ko, para saan magagamitin ni Sarah ito, ni Seth?

00:58:23.140 --> 00:58:24.220
Sen. Panfilo M. Lacson: Hindi na

00:58:24.220 --> 00:58:25.280
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: ba ninyo tinatanong?

00:58:25.710 --> 00:58:36.290
Violeta Constantino: Kasi po may advice naman po siya. So kumbaga dumaan naman po ito sa proseso nila. Kaya I don't think po na magtanong pa kami.

00:58:36.390 --> 00:58:50.770
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: What is the SOP? Ano po ang standard operating procedure pag may mga malalaking withdrawal? Or exempted pag mga government agency lalo po at mga matataas na ahensya ng pamahalaan?

00:58:51.840 --> 00:59:00.480
Violeta Constantino: Wala na pong exemption. Kaya lang po itong sa particular na transaction po ng OVP, bali meron naman po kasi silang pinu-forward na advice po sa branch.

00:59:01.460 --> 00:59:02.020
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Okay.

00:59:04.080 --> 00:59:07.940
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Alam niyo po ba na ito ay for intelligence fund, yung winning withdraw?

00:59:08.560 --> 00:59:09.360
Violeta Constantino: Hindi po.

00:59:09.660 --> 00:59:12.000
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Hindi niyo po alam na intel fund ito?

00:59:12.160 --> 00:59:12.400
Violeta Constantino: Opo.

00:59:12.560 --> 00:59:16.560
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Pero nagduda po kayo sa ganitong kalaking halaga. Is that correct?

00:59:17.960 --> 00:59:30.500
Violeta Constantino: Sa personal opinion namin, sa banko. Parang siyempre po, saan kaya gagamitin po yung cash na ito? Pero hindi naman po namin tinanong na kasi may advice naman po siya.

00:59:30.680 --> 00:59:36.600
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Okay, panghuli na lamang po Madam Witness. May other agencies pa ba na may account sa inyo?

00:59:38.800 --> 00:59:41.600
Violeta Constantino: Marami naman po mga government agencies po sa

00:59:41.600 --> 00:59:47.860
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: branch ninyo. Pero walang mga ganito kalalaking withdrawal?

00:59:49.050 --> 00:59:59.630
Violeta Constantino: So far po kasi nag-convert na po lahat kasi sila sa mga online system like yung sa ATM payroll. So hindi na po ganyang kalalaki yung mga withdrawals po nila.

01:00:00.000 --> 01:00:02.020
Sen. Erwin Tulfo: Thank you Madam Witness. Thank you Presiding Officer.

01:00:02.340 --> 01:00:11.020
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: Thank you Senator Judge Erwin Tulfo. Senator Judge Rafi Tulfo is recognized. You may proceed sir when you're ready for interjections and interventions. You have two minutes sir.

01:00:20.470 --> 01:00:22.210
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: Madam Witness, magandang umaga po.

01:00:22.390 --> 01:00:23.410
Violeta Constantino: Magandang umaga rin po. Hindi

01:00:23.410 --> 01:00:29.310
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: masyado klaro sa amin yung sinabi mong mga bag ang pinaglagyan nitong 125 million. Anong klaseng bag muli?

01:00:30.890 --> 01:00:37.690
Violeta Constantino: Sa pagkakaalala ko po, ito po isang malaking, mahabang bag. Parang diniscribe ko nga po as... Duffel

01:00:37.690 --> 01:00:38.550
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: bag? Gym bag?

01:00:38.870 --> 01:00:42.190
Violeta Constantino: Gym bag po. Iba po kasi yung duffel bag sa bangko. So gym

01:00:42.190 --> 01:00:43.110
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: bag, ano kalaking?

01:00:43.490 --> 01:00:44.090
Violeta Constantino: Mahaba po.

01:00:44.350 --> 01:00:57.010
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: Okay. Ayon sa BSP, ang 1 million approximately 1 kilo. So that's 125 million. So si Gina lamang ang nagbit-bit ng 125 kilos palabas ng bangko?

01:00:57.350 --> 01:01:02.810
Violeta Constantino: Ang alam ko pong assistance na naalala ko po ay nag-provide po kami ng trolley.

01:01:03.960 --> 01:01:05.400
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: At mag-isa lang si Gina?

01:01:05.820 --> 01:01:08.800
Violeta Constantino: May kasama po sila eh. Hindi ko lang po ma-recall. So

01:01:08.800 --> 01:01:09.780
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: ilang daffle bag po ulit?

01:01:10.380 --> 01:01:13.040
Violeta Constantino: Mga 3 to 4. Bags po.

01:01:13.760 --> 01:01:15.640
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: I mean, 3 to 4.

01:01:16.620 --> 01:01:17.460
Violeta Constantino: Gym bags.

01:01:18.040 --> 01:01:18.580
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: Gym bags.

01:01:20.900 --> 01:01:35.320
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: Dapat sigurado. 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10. Kasi... Kung 125 million at tatlong gym bag, eh yung gym bag, ano lang kalaki yun? Mahaba. Mahaba. Kakasya ba dyan 125 kilos?

01:01:35.660 --> 01:01:36.480
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: 31 million per.

01:01:36.660 --> 01:01:37.220
Violeta Constantino: Baka

01:01:37.220 --> 01:01:37.940
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: nagkakamali kayo.

01:01:38.640 --> 01:01:40.880
Violeta Constantino: Mga 3 to 4 bags nga po.

01:01:40.880 --> 01:01:41.060
Violeta Constantino: Dapat

01:01:41.060 --> 01:01:48.020
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: precise po kayo. Dapat dina-jet daw nyo yan bago paglabas. 3 bags ang lumabas, ang pinaglagyan.

01:01:48.620 --> 01:01:50.820
Violeta Constantino: Hindi na po namin yan ano po.

01:01:50.940 --> 01:02:01.420
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: Okay, sige. Pero dapat, you should be approximate, I mean precise kasi we're talking of impeachment of the vice president dito. Hindi dapat yung parang kalkulasyon-kalkulasyon lamang. As much as possible.

01:02:01.980 --> 01:02:03.720
Violeta Constantino: Opo, mga ganun, four bags.

01:02:03.880 --> 01:02:23.330
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: Okay, four bags. Now, wala bang, kasi alam ko pag ganun kalaki amount, kuminsan yung bank ko nag-offer doon sa depositor. na i-deliver yung pera sa lugar na gusto nilang pupuntahan ng pera ngayon through the what we call armored car or armored vehicle. Hindi kayo nag-provide na ganoon?

01:02:23.750 --> 01:02:30.710
Violeta Constantino: Hindi po. Wala po kasi kaming memorandum of agreement regarding po sa services, cash services or cash delivery.

01:02:31.150 --> 01:02:39.210
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: So hindi nag-request yung OVP ng cash delivery through armored vehicle papunta doon so back to their office. Okay.

01:02:40.730 --> 01:02:43.170
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: Curious lang po, sino itong... Mayroon pa

01:02:43.170 --> 01:02:56.530
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: isang pangalan nakapirma sa baba ng cheque, itong Rosaline L. Sanchez. Sa pagkakalam mo. Kasi diba sa baba, nakalagay Rosaline Sanchez and then Lemuel Ortonio, signatory doon sa paglilis ng cheque. Who are they?

01:02:57.250 --> 01:03:03.590
Violeta Constantino: Authorized signatory po. Isa po siya sa authorized signatories po ng Office of the Vice President. Si

01:03:03.590 --> 01:03:04.810
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: Rosaline Sanchez, sino po ito?

01:03:06.190 --> 01:03:06.710
Violeta Constantino: Sa

01:03:06.710 --> 01:03:07.470
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: pagkakalam niyo po.

01:03:07.990 --> 01:03:12.400
Violeta Constantino: Ang alam ko po, siya po yung sa finance. Sa

01:03:12.400 --> 01:03:23.180
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: finance. Okay, nabagit nyo rin po prior dun sa withdrawal, you're given one or two days para makapag-prepare ng cash. Sino po ulit tumatawag sa inyo?

01:03:23.520 --> 01:03:25.340
Violeta Constantino: Si Ms. Queenie Masangkay po.

01:03:25.580 --> 01:03:28.460
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: Paano po nalaman na si Ms. Queenie Masangkay tumatawag sa inyo?

01:03:28.720 --> 01:03:34.120
Violeta Constantino: Na-meet ko na rin po siya sa branch nung nag-open po sila ng MDS account po.

01:03:35.090 --> 01:03:51.270
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: Okay, last na naman. Usually pag ganun kalaking amount ang mini-withdraw, Sinisiguro nyo na yung pupunta doon sa banko, yun yung authorized na mag-withdraw talaga ng perang yan. Kadalasan tinatawagan pa yung principal. Wala kayong ganong klase ng protocol in place?

01:03:52.190 --> 01:03:53.950
Violeta Constantino: Wala na po kasi may advice na po siya.

01:03:54.650 --> 01:03:55.890
Sen. Raffy Tulfo: Wala na? May advice na po

01:03:55.890 --> 01:03:56.010
Violeta Constantino: siya.

01:04:00.070 --> 01:04:02.530
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: Bago po yung bell, Senator Judge Raffi.

01:04:06.200 --> 01:04:06.680
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: Next.

01:04:08.310 --> 01:04:13.690
Sen. Francis “Chiz” Escudero: To be recognized for his interjections would be Senator Bam Aquino. You have two minutes, sir.

01:04:13.850 --> 01:04:14.470
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Maraming salamat, Mr.

01:04:14.470 --> 01:04:17.870
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Presiding Officer. Ms. Violeta, magandang umaga.

01:04:18.010 --> 01:04:18.990
Violeta Constantino: Magandang umaga din po.

01:04:19.190 --> 01:04:22.490
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Kaklaruin ko lang po, yung cheque ay mula po kanino?

01:04:23.190 --> 01:04:25.170
Violeta Constantino: Mula po sa Office of the Vice President.

01:04:25.210 --> 01:04:31.990
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Hindi po, diyan po napunta yung pondo, no? But kayino po, anong account galing po yung perang yan?

01:04:32.430 --> 01:04:34.510
Violeta Constantino: Sa Office of the Vice President nga po.

01:04:34.630 --> 01:04:39.930
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Because it was already downloaded to the Office of the Vice President from the Treasury. Is that correct?

01:04:40.270 --> 01:04:40.490
Violeta Constantino: Opo.

01:04:40.630 --> 01:04:47.790
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: So this is OVP funds na napunta kay Ms. Gina Acosta na SDO po nila. Tama po.

01:04:47.870 --> 01:04:50.510
Violeta Constantino: Basta po si Ms. Gina yung payee po ng cheque.

01:04:50.630 --> 01:04:55.990
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Yung payee. Okay. Nabanggit niyo po kanina na unusual po yung laki.

01:04:57.710 --> 01:05:09.110
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Kapag ganun po, Do you report this to any agency? Kung nagtatakahan nyo po na parang laki naman ito. Do you do any reporting or wala na pong reporting yan?

01:05:09.290 --> 01:05:18.150
Violeta Constantino: I'm sorry, Your Honor. May we invoke po yung AMLA rule na hindi po kami pwede mag-disclose any information po regarding sa reporting.

01:05:18.750 --> 01:05:19.530
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Sa reporting?

01:05:21.200 --> 01:05:21.760
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Okay.

01:05:21.820 --> 01:05:22.700
Violeta Constantino: AMLA rule po siya.

01:05:23.000 --> 01:05:29.520
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: Let me rephrase the question. Ang government transactions po ba ay sakop ng AMLA rules?

01:05:34.340 --> 01:05:37.720
Violeta Constantino: Makakasagot po yan ang AMLC po. Hindi,

01:05:37.740 --> 01:05:51.300
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: pwede niyong sabihin. Hindi ko po alam yung sagot. Kayo po yung isang branch manager. So kayo po yung nasa landmark ng ilan taon. Alam niyo po yung mga rules. Nais ko lang pong malaman kung ang government transactions ba ay sakop ng AMLA regulations po natin.

01:05:51.460 --> 01:05:53.660
Violeta Constantino: Wala naman pong exemption po doon. So

01:05:53.660 --> 01:05:54.300
Sen. Paolo Benigno “Bam” Aquino: sakop po siya?

01:05:55.160 --> 01:05:55.660
Violeta Constantino: Sakop po.

